            "scripts/engineering-fluid-core-smoketest.ts (Re=99,600 exact, laminar f=64/Re, Swamee–Jain vs Blasius 0.316/Re^0.25 within a few %, Δp = f(L/D)ρV²/2 = ρg·h_f, continuity round-trip), "
